-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Flat2D.IsSol2.mul_const","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Flat2D.IsSol2.mul_const","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Flat2D.lean#L44-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Flat2D.form_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Flat2D.form_apply","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Flat2D.lean#L38-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Flat2D.form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Flat2D.form","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Flat2D.lean#L32-L35","doc":"The connection form `v ↦ v.1 • fa p + v.2 • fb p`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Flat2D.IsSol2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Flat2D.IsSol2","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Flat2D.lean#L27-L30","doc":"`S` solves `∂_a S = Ωa S`, `∂_b S = Ωb S` at every point of `D`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}